{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國加州北區聯邦地區法院法官託馬斯·希克森10月19日下令，要求Meta説明哪些員工參與或批准了通過BitTorrent下載LibGen和Anna’s Archive等「影子圖書館」數據集的決定。披露範圍不僅包括實際操作下載的人，也包括參與討論、批准使用BT，以及決定是否向其他用户上傳文件或如何減少上傳行為的人員。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583226.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:46.053712+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:13:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:57:59.265133+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"3a1baf1a6fc31f3fb1781d55694ff033ad1a4d0b19350fd00e7457cd71ae8635","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}